# Raw and reduced session telemetry (tools/telemetry) is transient local evidence, never
# durable repository state — see tools/telemetry/README.md.
.claude/telemetry/

# Per-session action-envelope stop markers (tools/orchestration/action-envelope-hook.mjs,
# issue #641) are transient live-session state, never durable repository state.
.claude/action-envelope-state/

# Dispatch/Agent-tool worktree checkouts and any worktrees pr-head-checkout-preflight.mjs
# (issue #692) creates under the primary checkout's own .claude/worktrees/ root are disposable,
# per-session working copies -- never durable repository content. Excluding them keeps the
# primary checkout's own index clean (Stage 1 review finding on PR #694: without this, a routine
# `git add .` in the primary checkout could stage a generated worktree as an embedded-repository
# gitlink).
.claude/worktrees/
